WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
How do you draw a solid, a liquid and a gas?

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.500
Use circles for particles.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.710
Solid: neat rows, all touching.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.010
Liquid: still touching, but jumbled.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.570
Gas: few particles, far apart.

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:21.013
Same circles, different arrangement.
